{"id":"chatcmpl-d721b382-efb9-4c16-ba9d-f007e3cbff6b","object":"chat.completion","created":1795247936,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a verification pattern for medical image interpretation: when a primary expert tool provides a finding with laterality, a second independent localization tool is used to cross-check the same claim before committing to an answer. The strategy emphasizes independent corroboration of spatial/lateral attributes rather than trusting a single source, and grounds the final answer in concrete localization evidence.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When options differ only by a spatial attribute (left vs right, upper vs lower), query the primary tool for both presence and the discriminating attribute explicitly.\",\n    \"Use a second, independent tool to verify the same spatial claim rather than re-asking the first tool, to avoid correlated errors.\",\n    \"Convert the final answer into a grounded localization (bounding region/coordinates) to confirm the attribute matches the chosen option.\",\n    \"Structure the query to force a binary/positional commitment (e.g., 'on which side?') so the tool's output directly maps to an answer option.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging interpretation\": \"Ask for finding presence plus the discriminating attribute (side, location, severity) in one query; corroborate with an independent localization tool before answering.\",\n    \"Multiple-choice with near-duplicate options\": \"Identify the single attribute that separates options, then design queries that elicit exactly that attribute from at least two sources.\",\n    \"Tool-based evidence gathering\": \"Pair a semantic/expert tool with a spatial/grounding tool so their outputs are complementary and independently verifiable.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the discriminating attribute (e.g., laterality) is explicitly stated by at least two independent tools.\",\n    \"Verify the grounded localization region is consistent with the chosen option's stated side/location.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":467,"total_tokens":836,"completion_tokens":369,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":467},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":369}}}